<!--
  Plunk subject line for shared entity-activity notifications.
  Paste into the Plunk template Subject field.

  Variables:
    mailSubject — activity-specific subject (without app name suffix)
    appName     — application name (e.g. Hibarr)

  Examples (mailSubject only):
    "New Note on Deal: Beach Villa"
    "Property Published: Sea View Apt"
    "Task Overdue: Follow up client"
    "New File on Lead: John Smith"

  Keep in sync with notification getEmailSubject() / mailSubject() methods.
-->
{{mailSubject}} - {{appName}}
